<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#e11d48" />
    <title>페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다 | MangaDrop</title>
    <meta name="description" content="찾으시는 페이지가 없습니다. MangaDrop 홈, 만화·웹툰·라노벨 목록 또는 발매 캘린더로 이동하세요." />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/global.css" />
    <style>
      body { min-height: 100vh; background: #fafaf9; color: #1c1917; }
      .site-header { border-bottom: 1px solid #e7e5e4; background: #fff; }
      .site-header-inner { max-width: 72rem; margin: auto; padding: 1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .brand { color: #e11d48; font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; font-weight: 700; }
      .site-nav, .recovery-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .75rem 1.25rem; }
      .site-nav a:hover, .recovery-links a:hover { color: #be123c; text-decoration: underline; }
      main { max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 6rem) 1rem; }
      .panel { padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 3rem); border: 1px solid #e7e5e4; border-radius: 1rem; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(28, 25, 23, .05); }
      .eyebrow { color: #be123c; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; }
      h1 { margin-top: .75rem; font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 2.5rem); line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 700; }
      .message { margin-top: 1rem; color: #57534e; line-height: 1.7; }
      .recovery { margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid #e7e5e4; }
      h2 { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 700; }
      .recovery-links { margin-top: 1rem; }
      .recovery-links a { border: 1px solid #fecdd3; border-radius: .6rem; padding: .65rem .9rem; color: #9f1239; font-weight: 600; }
      .recovery-links a:first-child { color: #fff; background: #e11d48; border-color: #e11d48; }
      .recovery-links a:first-child:hover { color: #fff; background: #be123c; }
      a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #e11d48; outline-offset: 3px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="site-header-inner">
        <a class="brand" href="/">MangaDrop</a>
        <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="주요 메뉴">
          <a href="/manga">만화</a>
          <a href="/webtoon">웹툰</a>
          <a href="/lightnovel">라노벨</a>
          <a href="/calendar">발매 캘린더</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main>
      <div class="panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">404 · Page not found</p>
        <h1>페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다</h1>
        <p class="message">주소가 잘못 입력되었거나 페이지가 이동되었을 수 있습니다. 아래에서 다시 찾아보세요.</p>
        <section class="recovery" aria-labelledby="recovery-title">
          <h2 id="recovery-title">다시 찾아보기</h2>
          <div class="recovery-links">
            <a href="/">홈으로</a>
            <a href="/manga">만화 목록</a>
            <a href="/webtoon">웹툰 목록</a>
            <a href="/lightnovel">라노벨 목록</a>
            <a href="/calendar">발매 캘린더</a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
